sequenceDiagram
    title Beads storage for CoBuilder — level 2: a slice lands

    actor Engineer
    participant impl as implement session
    participant bd as bd 1.3.0
    participant fs as docs/ + .cobuilder/
    participant idx as build_index.py
    participant gh as GitHub

    impl->>bd: bd ready
    bd-->>impl: slice n is next (ladder projection)
    impl->>fs: append attempt evidence file
    impl->>bd: bd update slice --metadata @envelope (attempts+1)
    impl->>bd: bd close slice --reason "ends_with verified"
    bd-->>impl: slice n+1 unblocked
    impl->>gh: open pull request (epic branch)
    impl->>bd: bd gate create "Merge PR" --type human --blocks epic
    Engineer->>gh: merge the pull request
    impl->>bd: bd gate resolve gate
    impl->>bd: bd close epic --reason merged
    idx->>bd: bd list --json
    idx->>fs: walk unchanged sources
    idx-->>idx: write data/index.json (same shape)
